# Conventional Commits template for IG Follow Analyzer
# Format: <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# <type>  : feat | fix | docs | chore | refactor | test | style | perf | ci | build
# <scope> : optional, e.g. upload, parser, pdf, history, ui, i18n
# <subject>: imperative, lowercase, no trailing period, <= 72 chars
#
# Body (optional): explain WHY, not WHAT. Wrap at 72 chars.
# Footer (optional): BREAKING CHANGE: ... or Closes #123
#
# Examples:
#   feat(upload): add drag-and-drop ZIP support
#   fix(parser): handle nested folder paths in Instagram export
#   docs(readme): clarify local history consent flow
#   chore(deps): bump fflate to 0.8.4
#
# --- delete below this line before committing ---

type(scope): subject

body (optional)

footer (optional)
